    <item>
      <title>Support</title>
      <link>https://ydjemmada.github.io/DZJC/SUPPORT.html</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://ydjemmada.github.io/DZJC/SUPPORT.html</guid>
      <description>&lt;div data-dzjc-lang-panel=&#34;en&#34; hidden&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Use the email template below to send a support request directly to &lt;a href=&#34;mailto:yahia.djem@gmail.com&#34;&gt;yahia.djem@gmail.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;dzjc-button-secondary&#34; href=&#34;mailto:yahia.djem@gmail.com?subject=DZ%20Journal%20Check%20support%20request&amp;amp;body=Hello%20Yahia%2C%0A%0AI%20need%20support%20for%20DZ%20Journal%20Check.%0A%0AProblem%20summary%3A%0A%0AWhat%20I%20expected%3A%0A%0AWhat%20happened%20instead%3A%0A%0AChrome%20version%3A%0ADZ%20Journal%20Check%20version%3A%0AOperating%20system%3A%0A%0APage%20URL%20or%20public%20Google%20Scholar%20result%20URL%3A%0ASearch%20query%3A%0AJournal%20title%3A%0AISSN%20/%20E-ISSN%3A%0ADOI%3A%0A%0AScreenshot%20attached%3A%20yes/no%0A%0AI%20confirm%20that%20I%20did%20not%20include%20passwords%2C%20cookies%2C%20private%20account%20data%2C%20or%20private%20Google%20Scholar%20profile%20information.%0A&#34;&gt;Open Support Email Template&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;DZ Journal Check is independent and unofficial. Please do not send passwords, authentication codes, cookies, private Google Scholar account details, or private profile information.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;before-reporting-a-problem&#34;&gt;Before Reporting A Problem&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Confirm that DZ Journal Check is enabled in Chrome.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Confirm you are using the latest extension version.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Try searching by ISSN, E-ISSN, or DOI when a title match is unclear.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Check whether Google Scholar is showing a journal venue, repository copy, arXiv preprint, book, thesis, or incomplete metadata.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Refresh the page once if Google Scholar dynamically loaded results after the extension started.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;what-the-email-template-includes&#34;&gt;What The Email Template Includes&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Chrome version.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;DZ Journal Check extension version.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Operating system.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Page URL where the problem occurred, if it does not expose private information.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Search query or public result URL.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Journal title.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Print ISSN.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Electronic ISSN.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;DOI, if available.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Screenshot with personal information hidden.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Expected result and actual result.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;incorrect-classification-reports&#34;&gt;Incorrect Classification Reports&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;For incorrect or missing journal classifications, use the dedicated &lt;a href=&#34;https://ydjemmada.github.io/DZJC/report-classification/&#34;&gt;classification report email template&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
